WEBVTT

00:01:52.560 --> 00:02:00.000
time on Dragon Ball Z Goku found himself in dire straits as a radical virus attacked his heart

00:02:00.190 --> 00:02:02.650
leaving him crippled with pain.

00:02:02.650 --> 00:02:03.830
- Go, hon!

00:02:08.600 --> 00:02:11.540
- Unable to respond to Android 19's offensive,

00:02:11.540 --> 00:02:13.940
the mighty Super Saiyan could only lie there

00:02:13.940 --> 00:02:18.970
and watch helplessly as the android robbed him of his energy.

00:02:18.970 --> 00:02:21.610
It was a theft that would have proved fatal for Goku

00:02:21.610 --> 00:02:27.160
if lightning hadn't struck in the form of Vegeta.

00:02:27.160 --> 00:02:30.000
After his dramatic entrance, the Saiyan prince astonished

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:34.960
everyone by transforming into a super saiyan right before their very eyes

00:02:34.960 --> 00:02:41.390
that's how I became a super saiyan the sleeper has awakened I am the prince of

00:02:41.390 --> 00:02:46.940
all saiyans once again you may have become a super saiyan but your newfound

00:02:46.940 --> 00:03:00.000
powers are still no match for us these demonstrate Android 19 androids there's one super

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:04.900
We're saying down and only one to go.

00:03:47.850 --> 00:03:49.970
Just as I thought, you're nothing.

00:03:52.210 --> 00:03:53.110
Silly robot.

00:03:54.150 --> 00:03:58.110
Do you really think you have a chance against a super saiyan like me?

00:03:58.450 --> 00:04:00.000
Your brain must be magical.

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:09.080
functioning fresh out of the factory with no warranty and already broken what a pity

00:04:30.540 --> 00:04:31.500
Vegeta!

00:04:31.500 --> 00:04:33.680
Huh? Huh?

00:04:33.680 --> 00:04:39.610
Mer function.

00:04:39.610 --> 00:04:42.930
My, my. What do we have here?

00:04:42.930 --> 00:04:43.730
Function?

00:04:43.730 --> 00:04:45.360
Oh, yes.

00:04:45.360 --> 00:04:49.250
The ultimate tub of lard bucket of bolts!

00:04:49.250 --> 00:04:52.600
HAHA!

00:04:52.600 --> 00:04:53.080
UGH!

00:05:00.730 --> 00:05:02.730
So, are you scared yet?

00:05:12.860 --> 00:05:19.370
You have an oil leak.

00:05:19.370 --> 00:05:22.400
What a bad deal. Such a fragile unit.

00:05:33.230 --> 00:05:34.040
Get out of here.

00:06:01.820 --> 00:06:05.000
Despicable! What a useless machine!

00:06:09.990 --> 00:06:15.200
I have you now, and soon I will have all of your energy!

00:06:18.450 --> 00:06:19.950
Oh no!

00:06:22.160 --> 00:06:25.540
Do not try to escape, yes? It is useless!

00:06:25.540 --> 00:06:29.320
Until I have your energy, I will never let you go.

00:06:29.320 --> 00:06:30.000
Never?

00:06:31.020 --> 00:06:32.630
Let's see.

00:06:43.090 --> 00:06:46.190
Well, so far, I'm impressed.

00:06:46.190 --> 00:06:49.240
You're very true to your word.

00:06:49.240 --> 00:06:54.520
But never can be a long time, Android.

00:07:04.920 --> 00:07:10.940
come on goku hang in there we're not gonna let you leave us again we're gonna beat this thing

00:07:10.940 --> 00:07:30.000
you seem like you're under a lot of pressure still think that you can hang on long enough to

00:07:30.030 --> 00:07:45.300
steal my energy I will never let you go yes that's the spirit android never say die

00:08:21.950 --> 00:08:30.000
are the devices that you androids use to rob people of their energy. What's the matter?

00:08:30.990 --> 00:08:33.090
AND NOW YOU DON'T WANT TO PLAY ANYMORE?!

00:08:33.090 --> 00:08:36.730
YOU WERE ENJOYING YOURSELF BEFORE!

00:08:36.730 --> 00:08:39.650
WHEN YOU WERE SUCKING THE LIFE OUT OF KECKAROT!

00:08:39.650 --> 00:08:50.420
SO I GUESS IT'S TRUE AFTER ALL!

00:08:50.420 --> 00:08:53.170
ANDROIDS DO EXPERIENCE FEARCE!

00:08:53.170 --> 00:09:00.000
*SCREAMS*

00:09:13.660 --> 00:09:21.710
absurd. It's enough because you're losing. You've come here to destroy us. You're going

00:09:21.710 --> 00:09:30.000
to have to finish what you started. Run out for you and

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:47.190
A little going present for you!

00:10:39.950 --> 00:10:45.170
I only wish there was a junkyard nearby so we could give him a proper burial!

00:11:23.770 --> 00:11:27.530
Wow, goodness. Would you look at the size of that?

00:11:28.910 --> 00:11:30.000
My gosh!

00:11:30.220 --> 00:11:32.180
We don't want to get caught in that smoke.

00:11:32.180 --> 00:11:35.830
We'd better go in low.

00:11:35.830 --> 00:11:40.390
Uma, let's just get the heck out of here, please.

00:11:40.390 --> 00:11:42.230
You coward, we're already there.

00:11:42.230 --> 00:11:43.730
No, turn around.

00:11:43.730 --> 00:11:45.530
It's not too late.

00:11:45.530 --> 00:11:47.070
Let go, you big oaf.

00:11:47.070 --> 00:11:48.910
We're going, and that's final.

00:11:48.910 --> 00:11:50.370
We could get killed.

00:11:50.370 --> 00:11:51.650
Now, look what you've done.

00:11:51.650 --> 00:11:53.420
You woke the baby.

00:11:53.420 --> 00:11:55.700
Big mouth, you scared him.

00:11:55.700 --> 00:11:58.170
It's that big, burly voice of yours.

00:11:58.170 --> 00:11:59.150
Say what?

00:11:59.150 --> 00:12:00.000
We're out of your mouth.

00:12:14.200 --> 00:12:15.200
Toast!

00:12:15.200 --> 00:12:16.380
Yeah.

00:12:16.380 --> 00:12:17.430
More like...

00:12:17.430 --> 00:12:19.430
Burnt Toast.

00:12:19.430 --> 00:12:20.610
Shit.

00:12:36.880 --> 00:12:40.260
- You are a bit stronger than I anticipated,

00:12:40.260 --> 00:12:42.390
but it is nothing I cannot handle.

00:12:42.390 --> 00:12:44.190
Your defeat is imminent.

00:12:50.660 --> 00:12:53.600
- Yes, your friend managed to steal quite a bit of energy

00:12:53.600 --> 00:12:55.880
from me before I stopped him.

00:12:55.880 --> 00:13:00.000
Now's your chance to beat me, a vicious attack.

00:13:00.280 --> 00:13:02.470
now could be sufficient.

00:13:02.470 --> 00:13:04.610
How can he be so confident?

00:13:04.610 --> 00:13:05.800
What is he hiding?

00:13:05.800 --> 00:13:12.200
Yes, he is shrewd.

00:13:12.200 --> 00:13:16.070
He seems completely at ease, but is he?

00:13:16.070 --> 00:13:18.170
Let me ask you this.

00:13:18.170 --> 00:13:22.540
What makes you think that you're going to do any better than him?

00:13:22.540 --> 00:13:23.940
You're an android too.

00:13:23.940 --> 00:13:27.440
I bet your head rolls just as well as his does.

00:13:27.440 --> 00:13:28.770
Fool.

00:13:28.770 --> 00:13:30.000
I am far superior.

00:13:30.000 --> 00:13:32.080
to the Android 19 model.

00:13:32.520 --> 00:13:33.960
Stamping you out of existence

00:13:33.960 --> 00:13:36.320
is a trifle for a unit like me.

00:13:38.140 --> 00:13:39.300
You're bluffing, friend.

00:13:39.440 --> 00:13:40.760
Let's see what you've got.

00:13:45.150 --> 00:13:47.950
Oh, man!

00:13:48.170 --> 00:13:49.310
There he goes!

00:13:49.530 --> 00:13:50.770
Wow, he's running!

00:13:52.250 --> 00:13:56.690
Hey, Baldi, hurry!

00:13:57.160 --> 00:13:58.780
Throw me one of those beans!

00:13:59.320 --> 00:13:59.590
Huh?

00:14:02.520 --> 00:14:04.310
- Hey, wait a sec.

00:14:04.310 --> 00:14:05.910
- Listen, you idiot.

00:14:05.910 --> 00:14:11.190
He's going to get away.

00:14:11.190 --> 00:14:13.140
- Krillin, do it.

00:14:13.140 --> 00:14:19.540
- Whatever you say, I'll give him a small one.

00:14:35.630 --> 00:14:39.250
I appreciate the assistance, but you're not needed here anymore.

00:14:39.250 --> 00:14:42.570
You should go home where it's safe. You'll only get in my way.

00:14:42.570 --> 00:14:50.340
Huh?

00:14:50.340 --> 00:14:55.860
He's the biggest jerk.

00:14:55.860 --> 00:14:59.730
I have to agree with you, but he's a genius when it comes to fighting.

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:02.880
Vegeta was weakened by the other android.

00:15:02.880 --> 00:15:08.140
He was vulnerable, so he bluffed and acted like he was eager to fight the next one.

00:15:08.140 --> 00:15:12.660
That other android could have defeated Vegeta if he would have called the bluff and attacked,

00:15:12.660 --> 00:15:14.580
but Vegeta was too convincing.

00:15:14.580 --> 00:15:16.860
Mentally, he's impossible to beat.

00:15:16.860 --> 00:15:19.890
He thinks of every conceivable advantage.

00:15:19.890 --> 00:15:22.790
And physically, he's reached a new plateau.

00:15:22.790 --> 00:15:25.910
I've never seen a power quite like his before.

00:15:25.910 --> 00:15:28.010
It's radical, just amazing.

00:15:28.010 --> 00:15:30.000
Wow!

00:15:30.060 --> 00:15:32.920
Do you think Vegeta's even stronger than my dad now?

00:15:32.920 --> 00:15:36.290
There's a good chance, yes, I think so.

00:15:36.290 --> 00:15:36.940
What?

00:15:36.940 --> 00:15:38.390
Wow, man, oh, man!

00:15:38.390 --> 00:15:39.480
Whoa!

00:15:39.480 --> 00:15:41.430
I say we go find them!

00:15:41.430 --> 00:15:46.580
Vegeta may be stronger than us, but that doesn't make him my boss.

00:15:46.580 --> 00:15:48.180
Yeah, mine either!

00:15:48.180 --> 00:15:50.200
We have just as much at stake!

00:15:50.200 --> 00:15:52.760
We can't just take off right now!

00:15:52.760 --> 00:15:55.300
There's no way!

00:15:55.300 --> 00:15:57.430
Agreed.

00:15:57.430 --> 00:15:59.760
He might need our help.

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:04.980
But no jumping in unless I say, I need to get you guys back to Goku in one piece.

00:16:04.980 --> 00:16:08.560
Vegeta's probably looking for him in the mountains as we speak.

00:16:08.560 --> 00:16:12.700
But he's going to be hard to find since we can't sense his energy level.

00:16:12.700 --> 00:16:15.850
So spread out, lay low and find that tin can.

00:16:15.850 --> 00:16:16.550
Got it.

00:16:16.550 --> 00:16:18.350
If you spot him, call it out.

00:16:18.350 --> 00:16:21.440
Right! Right!

00:17:13.440 --> 00:17:14.390
Come out!

00:17:14.390 --> 00:17:15.350
Show yourself!

00:17:15.350 --> 00:17:18.820
When do you want to play hide and seek?

00:17:18.820 --> 00:17:23.820
If you androids experience fear, you must feel shame too!

00:17:23.820 --> 00:17:25.920
So stop running away and fight!

00:17:30.990 --> 00:17:37.350
This is ridiculous! An android that's scared to die! What a low-rate pile of junk!

00:17:37.350 --> 00:17:43.130
No guts at all, just circuits and wires!

00:17:43.130 --> 00:17:48.110
Fool! I'm not going to stand here all day and night!

00:17:48.110 --> 00:17:52.190
If you won't come out now, I'll blast you out!

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:03.500
This is your last chance! Come out now or else!

00:18:03.500 --> 00:18:11.460
So be it! Huh?

00:18:11.460 --> 00:18:14.670
Have it your way, you old rust bucket!

00:18:14.670 --> 00:18:16.530
*grunt*

00:18:16.530 --> 00:18:21.080
NOOOOO! We're down here too!

00:18:21.080 --> 00:18:23.400
Oh no! Oh no!

00:18:23.400 --> 00:18:24.640
*grunt*

00:18:31.150 --> 00:18:32.600
Ha, ha, ha!

00:19:16.570 --> 00:19:21.120
Thanks for the charge, you fool!

00:19:21.120 --> 00:19:29.320
Darn it! He tricked me!

00:19:30.670 --> 00:19:59.890
Had to go and give him all of that.

00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:04.660
Energy! Darn, how could I? A mistake like that is inexcusable!

00:20:17.660 --> 00:20:23.850
His frustration is apparent. He is no longer the cool, confident fighter that he was before.

00:20:24.690 --> 00:20:28.320
Perhaps the great Vegeta can be beaten after all.

00:20:35.920 --> 00:20:38.320
- The risk of fighting him in my present condition

00:20:38.320 --> 00:20:39.970
is still too great.

00:20:39.970 --> 00:20:44.360
I must recharge to maximum power if I am to beat him.

00:20:44.360 --> 00:20:47.120
I will wait for another opportunity to steal more energy,

00:20:47.120 --> 00:20:49.920
but Vegeta will not make the same mistake twice.

00:20:49.920 --> 00:20:53.490
There must be a way to acquire more energy, but how?

00:20:53.490 --> 00:20:56.630
Hm?

00:20:56.630 --> 00:20:57.400
Who is that?

00:21:02.110 --> 00:21:03.710
Yes, it is the boy.

00:21:04.590 --> 00:21:07.290
So, he followed us after all.

00:21:08.900 --> 00:21:13.390
Another one I see.

00:21:14.260 --> 00:21:30.000
Hmm, as well.

00:21:41.870 --> 00:21:48.620
- So they are all here.

00:21:48.620 --> 00:21:51.670
- It seems I have just solved my energy problem.

00:22:09.630 --> 00:22:14.110
Yes, I will steal the energy from these pathetic fools one by one.

00:22:14.110 --> 00:22:16.640
Then Vegeta is mine.

00:22:18.460 --> 00:22:22.340
Android 20 has formulated a plan.

00:22:22.340 --> 00:22:24.250
Beware, Defenders of Earth.

00:22:24.250 --> 00:22:26.140
There's a thief in your midst.

00:22:26.140 --> 00:22:29.670
And what this thief steals, you can never get back.

00:22:30.030 --> 00:22:32.500
on the next Dragon Ball Z.
